.gitignore
SHA256SUMS
# Anchored to the package root: excludes only this package's own top-level
# node_modules (irrelevant anyway once packaged with --no-dependencies).
# NOT `node_modules/**` (unanchored) — that would also match and exclude
# dist/node_modules/, which is the CLI's own bundled runtime dependency
# tree that scripts/bundle-cli.mjs builds (@tokenlighten/mcp-server,
# web-tree-sitter, tree-sitter-wasms, etc.) and that the vsix must ship.
/node_modules/**
